    "title": "Garcia, Braun power sixth ranked Waipahu past Waianae - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ScoringLive staff ,\n21 hours ago Waipahu piled up 590 yards of offense and got big nights from its quarterback-receiver tandem in a 42-14 win over Waianae on Friday. Jake Garcia completed 19 of 34 passes for 388 yards and four touchdowns, with Jayse Braun accounting for three of those scores on eight catches for 222 yards, both season high yardage totals. Tristan Pacheco added 189 rushing yards and two touchdowns on 21 carries as Waipahu produced 202 yards on the ground to complement its passing attack. Read full article\n1",
